OL,3,GNEWSADriver heard victim being dragged
OL,4,Aunder car, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA passenger in a car that dragged a
OL,10,Fhead teacher to his death for more than
OL,11,Fa mile has told a murder trial the
OL,12,Fdriver could hear the victim from
OL,13,Finside the vehicle after hitting him.
OL,15,FGabrielle Debotte said she "still had
OL,16,Fvisions" of the moment her cousin,
OL,17,FSimon Richardson, hit 56-year-old
OL,18,Fcyclist Michael Mullins at 18:07 BST on
OL,19,F20 April before driving away.
